Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

adaptiSeq is a Python reimplementation and extension of iSeq
(https://github.com/BioOmics/iSeq). Its accession resolution, metadata
retrieval, integrity checking, and merge behaviour are derived from iSeq, which
is distributed under the MIT License. The iSeq copyright and permission notice
is reproduced below as that license requires.

