The segmented, resumable transfer engine (adaptiseq/engine/segmented.py, with
the supporting adaptiseq/engine/gate.py and adaptiseq/engine/throughput.py) is
ported from FastBioDL
(https://github.com/swargo98/FastBioDL-Adaptive-Parallel_Downloader): Swargo RM,
Arslan E, Arifuzzaman M. "Adaptive Parallel Downloader for Large Genomic
Datasets." arXiv:2508.05511. FastBioDL is distributed under the MIT License. Its
copyright and permission notice is reproduced below as that license requires.

